# {{ app_title if app_title else project_name }}

A Next.js app deployed on [Databricks Apps](https://docs.databricks.com/en/dev-tools/databricks-apps/index.html).

## Local development

```bash
npm install
dex run dev     # starts Next.js dev server at http://localhost:3000
```

## Deploy to Databricks

Set your workspace URL in `databricks.yml`, then:

```bash
dex run deploy  # builds the app, then: databricks bundle deploy
```

`dex run deploy` depends on `dex run build` — it builds the app locally first,
then uploads the pre-built output (`.next/`) as part of the bundle.
The Databricks App just runs `next start -p 8080` against the pre-built files.

## Project structure

```
src/
  app/
    layout.tsx   Root layout
    page.tsx     Home page — edit this
databricks.yml   Databricks Asset Bundle config
dex.toml         dex project config and tasks
package.json     npm dependencies and scripts
next.config.ts   Next.js config
```
